<section id="what">
<h2>What to write to us about</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Corrections.</strong> If a price, certification or company fact on a review is wrong, send the page link and a public source. See how we handle corrections in our <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>.</li>
<li><strong>Providers.</strong> If you work at a company we review, you can <a href="/placement-options/">claim your profile</a> to send documentation and respond to the review.</li>
<li><strong>Everything else.</strong> Questions about a ranking, a guide or the site itself.</li>
</ul>
</section>
<section id="not">
<h2>What we can't help with</h2>
<p>We don't verify identities or businesses and we aren't BeenVerified, the US people-search service. We can't look up records about a person, and please don't send identity documents. Our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> explains how we handle email.</p>
</section>
<section id="email">
<h2>Email</h2>
<p><a href="mailto:support@beverified.org">support@beverified.org</a></p>
</section>
